sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Browser as Browser
    participant Dash as odh-dashboard<br/>model-registry BFF
    participant AuthP as Registry auth proxy<br/>(operator-managed)<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Reg as model-registry proxy<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant RegDB as MySQL / PostgreSQL<br/>3306 or 5432/TCP
    participant Cat as model-catalog<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant CatDB as model-catalog-postgres<br/>5432/TCP
    participant HF as huggingface.co / git<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Job as async-upload Job
    participant Store as S3 / OCI<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Sig as Sigstore<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Ctrl as ISVC controller<br/>(in model-registry-operator)

    Note over Browser,RegDB: Flow 1: Register and query models via the dashboard
    Browser->>Dash: HTTPS 443 via Platform Gateway<br/>TLS 1.2+, OAuth/OIDC bearer
    Dash->>AuthP: HTTPS 8443 (operator-defined)<br/>TLS, user bearer token (SAR)
    AuthP->>Reg: HTTP 8080 in-pod/loopback<br/>no encryption, no auth
    Reg->>RegDB: DB wire<br/>optional TLS 1.2+ (verify off by default)<br/>DB password
    RegDB-->>Reg: rows
    Reg-->>AuthP: JSON
    AuthP-->>Dash: JSON
    Dash-->>Browser: UI

    Note over Cat,HF: Flow 2: Model Catalog ingestion (leader only) and browsing
    Note over Cat: Init containers copy benchmark data<br/>and default sources to /shared-data
    Cat->>CatDB: Acquire pglock catalog-leader<br/>PostgreSQL 5432, password
    Cat->>HF: HTTPS 443, TLS<br/>optional HF_API_KEY / git creds
    HF-->>Cat: model / skill metadata
    Cat->>CatDB: Upsert catalog entries<br/>PostgreSQL 5432 (TLS not configured)
    Dash->>Cat: GET /api/*_catalog/*<br/>HTTP 8080 via operator-managed proxy<br/>user token checked at proxy
    Cat-->>Dash: catalog JSON

    Note over Dash,Sig: Flow 3: Async model upload Job
    Dash->>K8s: Create Job, Secret, ConfigMap<br/>HTTPS 6443, TLS 1.2+, user/SA token
    K8s->>Job: Schedule pod (credentials from Secret)
    Job->>Store: Download source (S3 / OCI / URI)<br/>HTTPS 443, AWS keys / registry creds
    opt --sign enabled
        Job->>Sig: Sign model + image<br/>HTTPS 443, projected SA OIDC token
    end
    Job->>Store: Upload to S3 or push ModelCar (skopeo)<br/>HTTPS 443, TLS verify on by default
    Job->>AuthP: Register model/version/artifact<br/>HTTPS 443, bearer user token, custom CA opt.
    AuthP->>Reg: HTTP 8080
    Reg-->>Job: created

    Note over K8s,Ctrl: Flow 4: InferenceService sync
    Ctrl->>K8s: Watch InferenceService, get Service<br/>HTTPS 6443, SA token
    Ctrl->>Reg: Update serving state<br/>HTTPS 443 or HTTP 8080, bearer token<br/>TLS 1.2 (skip-verify optional)
    Reg-->>Ctrl: OK
    Ctrl->>K8s: Patch ISVC labels / finalizer<br/>HTTPS 6443, SA token
